  "notes": [
    "Candidate selection for a first private engine build, not a license approval or build grant.",
    "SDL comes from the existing private Mali-fbdev SDL prefix (sdl_system=enabled); the vendored SDL 2.28.1 wrap and its X11/Wayland/ANGLE/udev/D-Bus/IBus/DRM branch are excluded.",
